*//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
* LT1499  10MHz, 6V/µs, Quad Rail-to-Rail Input and Output   //
*         Precision C-Load Operational Amplifier             //
*//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
*
* connections:     non-inverting input
*                  |   inverting input
*                  |   |   positive power supply
*                  |   |   |   negative power supply
*                  |   |   |   |   output
*                  |   |   |   |   |
*                  |   |   |   |   |
.SUBCKT LT1499     3   2   7   4   6
X_LT1499 3 2 7 4 6 LT1498
.ENDS LT1499
*
*
.SUBCKT LT1498     3 2 7 4 6
*
*Q4 17 11 18 [4] P1 1.006
*Q3 16 10 15 [4] P1 1
*Q5 33 32 14 [4] P1 1
*QIC2 10 10 11 [4] P1 1
