*Q3C 17 10 10 [4] P1 1.5
*Q1 12 11 20 [4] N1 1.006
*Q2 13 10 21 [4] N1 1
*Q2C 12 10 10 [4] N1 1.5
*Q1C 13 11 11 [4] N1 1.5
